Badge details

Description of this badge

This badge recognizes learners who have demonstrated keyboarding proficiency through measured typing speed and accuracy. Recipients have completed a keyboarding assessment and achieved a minimum net speed aligned with career readiness standards, supporting success in technical and professional environments.
Earning Criteria
Recipients must complete the earning criteria to earn this badge

Learners must complete a keyboarding speed and accuracy assessment and submit proof of results. To earn this badge, students must demonstrate a minimum net typing speed of 50 words per minute (WPM) with accuracy, as measured by an approved typing assessment tool.
Submission requirements:

• Upload a screenshot of typing test results
• Results must clearly display typing speed (WPM) and accuracy
• Assessment must be completed during the course

This benchmark aligns with entry-level workforce expectations and supports readiness for roles requiring efficient computer-based work.

